      "writtenOn": "2023-05-17T11:10:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ve seen that every host command driver ignores the `EC_RES_IN_PROGRESS` result code e.g.:\n```\n\t/* Ignore in-progress on LPC since interface is synchronous anyway */\n\tif (args-\u003eresult \u003d\u003d EC_RES_IN_PROGRESS)\n\t\treturn;\n```\n\nIt is used for the `EC_CMD_GET_COMMS_STATUS` and `EC_CMD_RESEND_RESPONSE` commands. It is not supported at the moment. Do you think it is required?",
      "parentUuid": "5656c1c8_f4bba689",
