      "side": 1,
      "message": "This will consume a bit of extra RAM.  We probably need to propose a common solution for reclaiming the main thread\u0027s stack by a separate thread upstream.\n\nLooks like the ITE based boards only have about 500 bytes RAM free.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 18,
